  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Support form triage\nScores each support form submission for priority, logs it, and pings you on urgent ones.\n\n**Setup:** add credentials to each node, replace every REPLACE_ME, test with one item, then activate.\n\n**Guardrails:** Adds a priority and one-line summary. It does not reply to the customer.\n\nBad or empty input stops the run and alerts you. No secrets are stored in this file.",
    "height": 220,
    "width": 560
   },
   "id": "support-form-triage-note",
   "name": "Read me",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
